  "_comment_purpose": "agentic_administration .claude/settings.json — copied from AOR templates/_shared/claude-settings.example.json (bee8f3c) with the stay-in-project-tree and no-sudo-as-shortcut settings-snippet.json deny arrays merged in (deduplicated). Three layers: allow = day-to-day autonomy; ask = anything that mutates a remote, destroys local state, or (host-specific) runs the live conformance suite, which writes to a real Plane board; deny = paths outside the project, elevation, destructive ops on main, and gh pr merge (Chris merges in the GitHub UI). A task needing a denied command is a chat discussion, not a deny-list edit.",
