  "_comment_hooks": "No hooks block here on purpose. The four module hooks (session-handoff SessionStart kickoff, git-flow-session-end Stop guard + PreToolUse gh-pr-create nudge, no-cat-head-via-bash PreToolUse re-read guard) already run from the shared global ~/.claude/settings.json (AOR dotfiles) on every Chris machine; three of them resolve to AOR-checkout paths, so repeating them here would double-fire. The vendored scripts under modules/ are what the global SessionStart hook finds via $CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR. Re-add a hooks block (see each module settings-snippet.json) if this repo is ever run without those dotfiles — e.g. at the Phase 7 public flip. Recorded in MODULES.md Override."
